# INGEST — Visual Glossary Enhanced (VIsualGlossaryEnhanced.jpg)  (2026-09-20)
##############################################################################

:Art_GlossaryEnhanced a dkg:VisualGlossary ;
    rdfs:label "Visual Glossary Enhanced (VIsualGlossaryEnhanced.jpg)" ;
    rdfs:comment "REVISION of the Simple glossary (overlap test: see report). 26 terms: 3 blue with a plus icon (Dinner, Menu, Course), 4 green with a plus icon (Help provider, Chef, Help Meal plan, Menu proposal), Meal drawn grey, the rest yellow. No legend, so the colours are recorded here and mapped to nothing." ;
    dkg:ingestedAt "2026-09-20"^^xsd:date .

:Con_Cook a dkg:Term ;
    dkg:source :Art_GlossaryEnhanced .
