:Art_Story_06d_Grandma a dkg:DomainStory ;
    rdfs:label "Domain Story 06d 'Grandma' (06d_DomainStoryGrandma.jpg)" ;
    rdfs:comment "6 sentences, no lanes. Same story as the Copy-of-Grandma picture (9 of 9 clauses match) with three differences: no 'optional' boxes, sentence 3 says 'Catastrophe Pictures', sentence 6 says 'Grandma Avatar'. Which of the two is current is not on either picture, so no dkg:revisionOf is asserted." ;
    dkg:ingestedAt "2026-09-20"^^xsd:date .

